        "name": "turnstage_review_response_quality",
        "toolReferenceName": "turnstage_review_response_quality",
        "displayName": "Review TurnStage response quality",
        "userDescription": "Run an explicit, bounded Advisory AI review that cannot change test outcomes.",
        "modelDescription": "Two-step advisory workflow. First disclose 1-10 manually selected response attempts after confirmation, capped at 8,000 characters each and 32,000 total. Then record fixed-rubric findings with the returned grantId. Prompts, headers, raw payloads, full URLs, and secrets are excluded. Findings never change formal TurnStage outcomes or CLI exit codes.",
